WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.419
Someone said to me recently after a show, 

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.920
they said, “Chris, can you say hi to my wife

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.546
after the show?”

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.631
You have a wife and you came to see me?

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.718
This is not for people with wives.

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.470
This is for theatre people who don’t get cast.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.930
&lt;i&gt;♪ Driscoll’s or a gerbil? ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.974
&lt;i&gt;♪ Should I get a Driscoll’s or a gerbil? ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.017
&lt;i&gt;♪ Should I get a Driscoll’s? ♪&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.977
I speak hyperbolically quite a bit

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.145
for comedic effect.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.480
Is we gonna ride on horses?

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.482
Thank you for choosing Delta.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.693
It doesn’t take a licensed psychologist

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.445
to tell you that something’s up.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.321
That’s good, buddy.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:32.115
Chris, my daughter loves your special.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.116
Love you, baby.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.659
Can’t believe you’re in jail.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.870
We’re gonna need you to get real close up

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:37.746
on the camera.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:39.497
Now we are stuck with these

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.082
unspeakable horrors.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:42.709
Who am I?

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.170
Are you gonna fill me in on what just happened?

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.132
My mom, she always wanted, like, a J. Crew son.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.633
Instead what she got is

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:52.761
the cheapest escort from Arizona.

